        154.39401245117188,
        95.74922943115234
      ],
      "text": "LEVEL OF EVIDENCE RATIONALE",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 7.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        100.94119262695312,
        376.3780517578125,
        111.3001937866211
      ],
      "text": "High Further research is very unlikely to change confidence in the estimate of effect.",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        116.07821655273438,
        384.0190124511719,
        126.43721771240234
      ],
      "text": "Moderate Further research is likely to have an important impact on confidence in the effect.",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        131.21511840820312,
        397.554931640625,
        141.57412719726562
      ],
      "text": "Low Further research is very likely to have an estimate of effect and is likely to change the",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        123.62200164794922,
        142.21511840820312,
        152.79100036621094,
        152.57412719726562
      ],
      "text": "estimate.",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        157.35220336914062,
        250.43214416503906,
        167.71121215820312
      ],
      "text": "Very low Any estimate of effect is very uncertain.",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Ligh",
      "size": 9.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        190.1359100341797,
        399.11163330078125,
        203.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "GRADE tables from systematic reviews were cross-checked, and where relevant,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        203.1359100341797,
        399.0929260253906,
        216.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "risk-benefit analysis was produced by the GSC. Internal discussions were held to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        216.1359100341797,
        399.1128845214844,
        229.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "evaluate the quality of the evidence presented to the GDG and needed to produce",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        229.1359100341797,
        399.1629943847656,
        242.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "draft recommendations, benefits, harms and risks, costs of implementation, and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        242.1359100341797,
        399.072998046875,
        255.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "acceptability. Recommendations were then formulated and drafted in accordance",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        255.1359100341797,
        399.11309814453125,
        268.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "with procedures outlined in the WHO Handbook for Guideline Development,  and  1",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        268.1358947753906,
        326.3028869628906,
        281.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "guided by the quality of evidence using the GRADE methodology.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        281.1358947753906,
        399.08154296875,
        294.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "In drafting the recommendations, the WHO Secretariat used those summaries of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        294.1358947753906,
        399.10284423828125,
        307.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "evidence for the critical outcomes (i.e. morbidity, mortality, disease progression and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        307.1358947753906,
        399.1328125,
        320.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "sequelae, or adverse events for medicines); quality of evidence; risks and benefits of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        320.1358947753906,
        396.8529052734375,
        333.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "implementing the recommendations; acceptability; costs; and feasibility. The recom­",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        333.1358947753906,
        399.0929870605469,
        346.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "men­dations were then were then ranked as strong or weak recommendation and",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        346.1358947753906,
        214.15289306640625,
        359.62591552734375
      ],
      "text": "research gaps or needs were identified.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        369.68341064453125,
        295.1069641113281,
        382.8724060058594
      ],
      "text": "2.3\t Consensus building and external peer review",
      "font": "Helvetica-Condensed-Bold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        386.30908203125,
        399.1429138183594,
        399.7991027832031
      ],
      "text": "Draft recommendations, along with the supportive evidence (including summary of",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        399.30908203125,
        399.0527648925781,
        412.7991027832031
      ],
      "text": "the evidence of the systematic reviews with risk-benefit analysis and GRADE tables)",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        412.1791076660156,
        399.1123046875,
        425.7991027832031
      ],
      "text": "Pocket Book were circulated to selected expert external reviewers and some   users for",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        98.6771011352539,
        425.089111328125,
        134.35708618164062,
        438.7991027832031
      ],
      "text": "Annex 4",
      "font": "MinionPro-Semibold",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        425.30908203125,
        399.0729064941406,
        438.7991027832031
      ],
      "text": "feedback ( ). This process was managed electronically through a (EZcollab",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        438.30908203125,
        399.0327453613281,
        451.7991027832031
      ],
      "text": "site accessible to external reviewers. Results of the peer review process were used to",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        451.30908203125,
        358.0529479980469,
        464.7991027832031
      ],
      "text": "modify the draft recommendations before presentation to the GDG panel.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        68.03150177001953,
        464.30908203125,
        396.8714599609375,
        477.7991027832031
      ],
      "text": "To formulate the final recommendations, these evidence summaries, with risk-",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        477.30908203125,
        399.03289794921875,
        490.7991027832031
      ],
      "text": "benefit analysis and GRADE tables, were presented and discussed at an expert panel",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        490.30908203125,
        399.1028747558594,
        503.7991027832031
      ],
      "text": "meeting held at WHO headquarters in Geneva, Switzerland, in February 2011. The",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        503.30908203125,
        399.1327819824219,
        516.799072265625
      ],
      "text": "panel weighed the quality of evidence, risks, and benefits, including acceptability,",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        516.30908203125,
        399.0328369140625,
        529.799072265625
      ],
      "text": "and placed emphasis on the values and feasibility of implementation in low-resource",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        529.30908203125,
        399.082763671875,
        542.799072265625
      ],
      "text": "settings while ensuring that the recommendations are in line with international",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        542.30908203125,
        399.0928955078125,
        555.799072265625
      ],
      "text": "standards of care. Although most decisions were based on the evidence from",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        555.30908203125,
        399.10302734375,
        568.799072265625
      ],
      "text": "randomized clinical trials (RCTs), or large effect observational cohort data, where the",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        568.30908203125,
        399.06298828125,
        581.799072265625
      ],
      "text": "panel determined that there was insufficient evidence, expert consensus was used.",
      "font": "MinionPro-Regular",
      "size": 10.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        56.692901611328125,
        597.0441284179688,
        398.6336669921875,
        607.9401245117188
      ],
      "text": "Handbook for Guideline Development. WHO   Geneva, World Health Organization, March 2010.  1",
      "font": "MinionPro-It",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
